t><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO SADAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SODICK CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HOSAKA, AKIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KHS CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, SADAO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SODICK CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HOSAKA AKIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO SADAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HOSAKA, AKIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, SADAO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An apparatus for electrodischarge machining comprises an electrode mount (42) for holding a tool electrode; a quill (41) for holding the electrode mount on the bottom and capable of moving in vertical directions; at least two linear motor rotors (43, 44) attached to the quill symmetrically with the axis of the quill; at least two linear motor stators (31, 32) opposed to the two rotors; and a counterbalance (6) acting against the weight of the quill. The counterbalance includes an air cylinder (60) arranged coaxially with the quill axis so that the balancing force may coincide with the quill axis. Preferably, the air cylinder is provided in a vertical hole extending along the axis of the quill.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un appareil de gravure par étincelage comprenant un support d'électrode (42) permettant de maintenir une électrode; une douille (41) permettant de maintenir le support d'électrode sur le fond et capable de se déplacer dans des directions verticales; au moins deux rotors de moteur linéaires (43, 44) fixés sur la douille symétriquement par rapport à l'axe de la douille; au moins deux stators de moteur linéaires (31, 32) opposés aux deux rotors; et un contrepoids (6) pour faire équilibre au poids de la douille. Le contrepoids comprend un cylindre pneumatique (60) disposé coaxialement à l'axe de la douille. De préférence, le cylindre pneumatique est pourvu d'un tube vertical s'étendant le long de l'axe de la douille.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>